  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.themeTitle">Theme</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.themesRebuilding">The previous themes have been removed — the set is being rebuilt. For now the POS runs in light or dark mode; the switch is in the header.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.themeDesc">Changes the accent color, button/card shape and window background across the whole app at once. Applies with one click.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.liquidGlassToggleTitle">Liquid glass</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.liquidGlassToggleDesc">On — glossy semi-transparent cards and blur on the till. Off — matte, barely transparent cards without blur.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.glassOpacityTitle">Glass transparency</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.glassOpacityDesc">How transparent the modal window and catalog tile cards are in the "Liquid glass" theme. Higher value — more transparent.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.customColorTitle">Custom accent color</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.customColorDesc">Enter a HEX color code (e.g. #FF6B00) — the other shades (soft background, hover, tiles) are picked automatically.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.radiusTitle">Corner rounding</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="marketplace.radiusDesc">Sets the shape of buttons and cards/windows separately from the color theme.</x:String>
