  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.languagePackHint">English, Turkish and Uzbek are a paid Language pack: Marketplace → Extras</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.uiScale">Scale</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.uiScaleDesc">Size of every element on the till screen — from 50% to 200%. Applies immediately, no restart needed.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.tileSize">Product tile size</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.tileSizeDesc">Larger is easier to tap on a touch screen, smaller fits more products on screen. The header and receipt stay the same.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.layoutMode">Main screen layout</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.screen.layoutModeDesc">Standard — catalog and cart side by side, resizable. 1C-style — large product tiles, receipt in a fixed column on the right, keypad for quantity. Applies immediately, no restart needed.</x:String>
